Zero point energy                ...      0.36949278 Eh     231.86 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01791698 Eh      11.24 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
